sequenceDiagram
participant C as ExamController
participant S as ExamService
participant T as Storage
participant OS as java.nio / OS
C->>S: submit(student, course, file, size)
S->>S: check window / registration / size
S->>T: save(file, bytes)
T->>OS: Files.writeString(...)
OS-->>T: throws IOException (NoSuchFileException)
T-->>S: throws SubmissionStorageException (cause = IOException)
S-->>C: propagates unchanged (throws ExamException)
C->>C: catch (ExamException e): log full trace, show friendly message
Note over C: Student sees: "We could not save your answer. Please try again in a minute."
